---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Guest Lectures" description="Invite Venu Uppaluri to speak on sustainability, analytics, AI, and decision-making.">
  <section class="border-b border-edge/15">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cyan-glow">Guest lectures &amp; speaker sessions</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.045em] text-fg sm:text-6xl">Ideas become useful when they are shared.</h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-mist-300">I speak with students, educators, and leaders about sustainability, analytics, AI, and how to make better decisions in an increasingly complex world.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cyan-glow">Session</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.035em] text-fg">Sustainability: the choices behind a better future.</h2>
      <img
        src="/images/guest-lecture-sustainability.jpg"
        alt="Slide from a sustainability session: 'Let's build our future' — a hand pulls back a cityscape to reveal a green field with a single tree."
        class="mt-6 w-full border border-edge/15 object-cover"
      />
      <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-mist-300">A session for school learners explored sustainability as a practical mindset: how everyday choices, systems thinking, and long-term responsibility connect.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-cyan-glow pl-5">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-fg">Suitable for schools, colleges, leadership forums, and learning communities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 border-t border-edge/15 pt-7">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Possible themes</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist-300">
          <li>• Sustainability and systems thinking</li>
          <li>• Analytics and AI for non-technical audiences</li>
          <li>• Careers and lifelong learning in a changing world</li>
          <li>• From insight to action: better decisions at work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border border-edge/15 bg-ink-900 p-6 sm:p-9">
      <p class="text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cyan-glow">Invite Venu to speak</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-fg">Tell me about your audience.</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist-300">Share a few details and I’ll respond with availability and a suggested format.</p>
      <form class="mt-8 grid gap-5" action="https://formsubmit.co/venu@decodewithvenu.com" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New guest lecture enquiry — Decode with Venu" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://www.decodewithvenu.com/thank-you" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Your name<input required name="name" class="form-input" autocomplete="name" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Work email<input required name="email" type="email" class="form-input" autocomplete="email" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Institution or organisation<input required name="organisation" class="form-input" /></label>
        <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Audience<select name="audience" class="form-input"><option>Students</option><option>Leadership Team</option><option>Analyst Forum</option><option>Analytics Conclave</option><option>Others</option></select></label>
          <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Preferred time slot<select name="time_slot" class="form-input"><option>30 mins</option><option>1 hr</option></select></label>
        </div>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Preferred date<input name="date" type="date" class="form-input" /></label>
        <label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">What would you like the session to cover?<textarea required name="message" rows="4" class="form-input resize-y"></textarea></label>
        <button type="submit" class="justify-self-start btn-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold">Send speaking enquiry</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
